WEBVTT

00:02:28.855 --> 00:02:31.165
Sometimes, she said,

00:02:31.189 --> 00:02:34.276
a late-term fetus
would survive an abortion,

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:37.009
and she would kill the baby
after delivering it.

00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:41.220
She remembered how her hands would tremble

00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:42.577
as she did the work.

00:02:43.815 --> 00:02:45.215
Her story shocked me.

00:02:45.934 --> 00:02:48.141
When I set out to make the film,

00:02:48.165 --> 00:02:52.582
I expected it would be a simple story
of perpetrators and victims.

00:02:52.606 --> 00:02:54.534
People who carried out the policy

00:02:54.558 --> 00:02:57.142
and people who are living
with the consequences.

00:02:57.701 --> 00:02:59.501
But that wasn't what I saw.